## Quick Start

**Fix a ticket** — paste into Copilot chat:

```
fix ticket

TicketID: PROJ-1234
Type: Bug|Enhancement|CR|Analysis
Description: <issue description>
```

**Fix accessibility issues** — pick the command that matches your source:

```
/fixada-file C:\Reports\scan.csv          ← single report file
/fixada-folder C:\Reports\               ← folder of reports
/fixada-results https://...              ← online report URL
/fixada-preventive C:\path\to\code\      ← pre-scan check of code
```

You only confirm at a few checkpoints: the analysis (tickets) or branch strategy (ADA), the commit
("yes"/"y"), reviewer emails, and the push ("PUSH"). Nothing is pushed without your explicit
approval. See [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) for the complete step-by-step flow, the ticket-type gate
(`Analysis` is read-only and never creates a branch or code), and the per-type build and reviewer
rules.

The workflow is configured to run on **{{REQUIRED_MODEL_LIST}}**; do not switch models mid-workflow.

