## Which Chat Mode to Use

| Work | Chat mode |
|---|---|
| `Analysis` tickets | Ask, Plan, or Agent mode (read-only) |
| `Bug` / `Enhancement` / `CR` tickets | **Agent mode** (or the `Ticket Processor` agent) — needs file edits, build, and git |
| ADA fixes (`/fixada-*`) | **Agent mode** (or the `Ticket Processor` agent) |

Starting a Bug/Enhancement/CR ticket in Plan mode stops after the pre-code analysis — that is
expected. Switch to Agent mode to continue. Details: "Which Chat Mode to Use" in
[`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).

